.* A list panel: options, two views, a column group, a truth table, a confirmation panel.
:PNLGRP DFTMSGF=QGPL/MYMSGF.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NUMCL BASETYPE='ZONED 5 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DATECL BASETYPE=DATE.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FLAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJSIZE CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJDATE CLASS=DATECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SHOWALL CLASS=FLAGCL VALUE='N'.
:VAR NAME=CANDLT CLASS=FLAGCL VALUE='Y'.
:VAR NAME=PGMNAME CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='QGPL/WRKOBJ'.
:VAR NAME=FILTER CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*ALL'.
:VARRCD NAME=EXITPARMS VARS='OBJNAME OBJLIB OBJTYPE' EXTVARS='NAME LIB TYPE'.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJLIST VARS='OPT OBJNAME OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJTEXT OBJSIZE OBJDATE' MSGID=MSG0010.
:COND NAME=ALL EXPR='&SHOWALL. EQ "Y"'.
:COND NAME=DLTOK EXPR='&CANDLT. EQ "Y"'.
:COND NAME=HASOBJS EXPR='%LIST(OBJLIST) GT 0'.
:COND NAME=TOPNODE EXPR='%NODE(OBJLIST) OR (&FILTER. NE "*ALL" AND &SHOWALL. EQ "N")'.
:TT NAME=OPTIONS CONDS='ALL DLTOK HASOBJS'.
:TTROW VALUES='1 1 1'.
:TTROW VALUES='1 0 X'.
:TTROW VALUES='0 X 1'.
:ETT.
:KEYL NAME=LISTKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5' VARUPD=NO.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display names only
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION=MOREKEYS.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PRINT ACTION=PRINT.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOBJ HELP=HLPWRKOBJ KEYL=LISTKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Objects
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH=2 LAYOUT=1.
:DATAI VAR=FILTER USAGE=INPUT HELP=HLPFILTER.Filter
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJLIST VIEWS=2 ACTOR=UIM EXTACT=YES MAXHEAD=2
      PARMS=EXITPARMS SCROLL=YES ENTER='RETURN 2' SELECT=MULTI ACTLEN=2
      BOTINST='More...'.
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2' HELP=HLPOPT2 VARUPD=YES.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4' CONFIRM=CFMDLT HELP=HLPOPT4 USREXIT='CALL PGMNAME' ACTFOR=LIST.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5' RETURN=5 ENTERMSG=MSG0020.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Display description
:LISTACT ENTER='RETURN 1'.
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT MAXWIDTH=2 HELP=HLPOPT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJNAME USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=10 NAME=NAME.Object
:LISTGRP COL=LOCATION.Location
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=10.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=8.Type
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=30 DISPLAY=YES.Text
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=7 DSPCOL=60 NOGUI.Size
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Changed
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT NAME LOCATION OBJTEXT' LAYOUT=1.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT NAME OBJSIZE OBJDATE' LAYOUT=1.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=CFMDLT KEYL=LISTKEYS HELP=HLPCFMDLT.Confirm Delete of Objects
:TOPINST.Press Enter to confirm your choices for 4=Delete.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJLIST.
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPWRKOBJ.Work with Objects - Help
:P.The list shows the objects the filter selects. &OBJNAME. is the
cursor's object.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPFILTER.Filter - Help
:P.A name, a generic name or &splat.ALL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPOPT.Options - Help
:P.Type an option next to an entry.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPOPT2.2=Change - Help
:P.Changes the object.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPOPT4.4=Delete - Help
:P.Deletes the object after confirmation.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPCFMDLT.Confirm Delete - Help
:P.Press Enter to delete, F12 to go back.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
